{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7757","id":5212937905,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNrcesQ","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7757","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7757.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7757.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7757","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7757/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7757/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7757/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/fba6bf708b917b47f7f2529ad2d1fa604ef66b94","number":7757,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(id): gate local_claims hex_bytes on ASCII hexdigits (#7750)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #7750\n\n`local_claims::hex_bytes` was the one pkgs/id hex parser without the #2517 ASCII-hexdigit gate: it sliced `&text[index..index+2]` at byte offsets, so a corrupt `local-claims.jsonl` field with a misaligned multi-byte character panicked at open instead of returning the designed `is not hex` error, and `+a`-style pairs decoded as `0x0a`.\n\n- Gate on `bytes().all(|b| b.is_ascii_hexdigit())`, mirroring `directory.rs::hex_to_array` / `directory_auth.rs::hex_bytes`.\n- Decode from `as_bytes().chunks(2)` — no str slicing at byte offsets, so no char-boundary panic is possible.\n- New regression test: plus pairs, misaligned multi-byte input (short and id-length), uppercase valid input, odd length, non-hex.\n\nVerified on the laptop: `cargo test -p id --lib local_claims` — 9 passed, 0 failed.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796746681&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7757&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7757&signature=559ca875acee191e9b1f5a4f5a1fa8b00dca03127f20fc75074d2ee48bb199cf\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7757?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[{"id":12834267441,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_PthMQ","url":"https://api.github.com